#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:5 11d496d630704d18b842d5e2c1f13917
#: 4244207bc1374b738d1ac44e07ccbe32 53f6d7ff29d54aa6897acad301a8ca55
#: acd1bdb027db4befadf89b5e09fb9877 b72ec80439a24cc29f25bd9c05acf964
msgid "Choosing an Autopilot"
msgstr "选择飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:7 5f7579010b4e4f7ba1154f0236753696
#: 81710629569348fcac731d237d1b2d21 94600c63cdb84f4d8736d5d198323438
#: af7f5009de8743abb3f403f92409214b bf3c63b82eb44bcd8280e383bfaa97f7
msgid ""
"ArduPilot runs on many different autopilot boards. Selecting the right board"
" depends on the physical constraints of the vehicle, features desired, and "
"the applications that you want to run. Factors to consider are:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 可在众多不同的飞控板上运行。选择合适的飞控取决于机体的物理约束、所需功能以及您希望运行的应用程序。主要考量因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:11 1c49327518344bdb979e1aa60733d52d
#: 3fa47798cd2444f7853a69cea8b0b19f 5b59840f88e94ed3998b7bce362eed7f
#: 6d69384348984488a20584daec0cea20 fe49cb8ee26b4456afc5f97aaff631af
msgid ""
"Sensor Redundancy: ArduPilot supports redundant IMUS, GPS, etc. Many "
"controllers have multiple IMUs integrated on board for applications "
"requiring this level of reliability."
msgstr "传感器冗余：ArduPilot 支持冗余 IMU、GPS 等。许多飞控板集成了多个 IMU，适用于对可靠性要求较高的应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:12 1d94189887d84487bd0c18b49346a114
#: 5025b3de804649d2941b816c5927ef11 7df556cca5af4ff2803fadfb77f3ad20
#: a71680b4a13b4173bb8147149b0073f3 fc25eb7901894400a348c8d42ad7991d
msgid "Number of Servo/Motor Outputs."
msgstr "舵机/电机输出数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:13 2d48581fc43743bb8808f9b3b6f1a649
#: 86b69be420d64a4281e91a1f270104c3 aab7a8718e72421fa0b0e7d0a65156be
#: d23004531f4944af8b0e7f6eb26bffad d316b96819a045db878c31b595dc7980
msgid ""
"Number of UARTs: Telemetry radios, GPS's, Companion Computers, etc can be "
"attached via these ports."
msgstr "UART 数量：数传电台、GPS、伴侣计算机等均可通过这些端口连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:14 9067021624da48b8859e93ebe0956c7f
#: 9e40d267bed24871a7e1bbd76421008c c6371250e57243a981abe13394e8389e
#: f1c7560c927248e285a414d832948fc1 ff7ba09dfaa14a068cd6bde420883abf
msgid ""
"External Buses: I2C, CAN, etc. allow many types of devices, such as airspeed"
" sensors, LED controllers, etc. to be attached to the autopilot."
msgstr "外部总线：I2C、CAN 等可连接多种设备，如空速传感器、LED 控制器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:15 25de5e788a1f4bec8d1e07113d0d7640
#: 4fe31a17febe4bc4ab17fe3230266ea0 53b60438c093492f82872e54457fd935
#: 68ca2d3586564ff9989177095878f795 c42a60746836462681d892965c03697b
msgid ""
"Number of Analog I/O: Some controllers have analog I/O available for such "
"features as inputting receiver signal strength (RSSI) or battery "
"voltage/current or other analog sensors."
msgstr "模拟 I/O 数量：部分飞控提供模拟 I/O，用于接收机信号强度（RSSI）、电池电压/电流或其他模拟传感器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:16 15e3961c9f01432fb7df18766e49ea6b
#: 7070376b7e5840ada6bee0d3a007c95e 9c381cd8e2484ad2b2126e1ea006f2dd
#: fd98f9b6728f45d5a38b913810d00d70 fe57c9b027d44b70af2ad5e276666080
msgid ""
"Integrated Features: Such as on-board OSD (On Screen Display), integrated "
"battery monitoring sensors."
msgstr "集成功能：如板载 OSD（屏幕显示）、集成电池监测传感器等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:17 11d184ec262f4e5481ae2a3af1190ebe
#: 17e7177db8b84ba6be0c2b2874c5b47f 69ef0d8245c04c86a92f0067842eedec
#: 856240afab5948eb9bc35dc73383f855 b75554382b92400db40b6e3a26d058cd
msgid ""
"Vibration Isolation: Internal mechanical vibration isolators for IMUs for "
"high vibration applications."
msgstr "减震隔离：为 IMU 提供内置机械减震，适用于高震动应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:18 38899077d2d74ee4a2d86a22f2dd0853
#: 56325c37985447bb8508682859b5b013 5efe056238264929be4ea67188c20e1f
#: a9afe89530be4f79afe043db249fb52e c06f533e2ff14e44b03ace09ed8f5462
msgid ""
"IMU Heaters: On board temperature control of IMUs for applications in harsh "
"environments or widely varying temperatures during a flight to provide the "
"highest possible precision."
msgstr "IMU 加热器：板载 IMU 温控，适用于恶劣环境或飞行中温度变化较大的场景，以提供尽可能高的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:19 00241754ca694b91acdfa0f0ed8a694f
#: 3821677239f742df88f318160931a926 d012bc4af1644a67adcd23a18fc2bc6f
#: dfa71911fa134010a4269b94ac6fed2e e019877077f94cfd835378928bc30a9a
msgid "Size: Many vehicles have limited space for the autopilot."
msgstr "尺寸：许多机体对飞控安装空间有限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:20 7a76f37aabdd4c20a54356263cf61cd6
#: a7be16ad03604241a3a060eb8eb49da5 d3c88c5cb6b94b4bac1c55b3355e4a27
#: da3cf0537abd478bb02dda1e95cda883 dbecbc7f0f864bbd8d2f0a188d0c7d83
msgid ""
"Expense: Controller prices range from ~$25 to much more, depending on "
"feature set."
msgstr "价格：飞控价格从约 25 美元到更高不等，取决于功能配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:22 197c19850d7b446c92f93b1befc38e2f
#: 56fbead16d1d476586e1122ad547788d a4d0d649de2147da85c1ee79caea65c9
#: ba7711c5c85941db92cd0fd72ddaf2bf ef1ddbd64d694933a9299a19bf5f56a8
msgid ""
"The sections below provide information about ArduPilot autopilot hardware "
"options.  The list below is sorted by manufacturer and product name."
msgstr "以下各节提供 ArduPilot 飞控硬件选项的相关信息。下列清单按制造商和产品名称排序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:26 072bbdfc8cd149f68730aaa97c5c8fbb
#: 3b873bddf6784ec4aa59d789a5e4a875 46f117cf2dc5491a8ca41c9651c55ca1
#: 7e50ab59fbc64fa48633c4ebe7c68af7 82f23867ca5d4aa7a2c0e661acb7ef11
msgid ""
"There are also numerous clones and minor variants of the boards linked "
"below. Many of these may be perfectly capable replacements. Help in "
"selecting an autopilot can also be obtained in the user forums (`ArduPilot "
"Discuss <https://discuss.ardupilot.org>`__ or `RC Groups "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3102183-Most-Integrated-"
"Ardupilot-Flight-Controller-%28ChiBios%29>`__ )."
msgstr ""
"以下链接中的飞控板还存在众多克隆版和小幅改型版，其中许多可作为完全可用的替代品。选择飞控时也可在用户论坛（`ArduPilot Discuss "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org>`__ 或 `RC Groups "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3102183-Most-Integrated-"
"Ardupilot-Flight-Controller-%28ChiBios%29>`__）中获取帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:33 4d407f77436a47ef8340198b83b37e8d
#: d80590a331154e3abc6d77678680b32f
msgid ""
"The APM2.6 board is no longer supported for Copter or Plane. The last "
"firmware builds that can be installed on these boards are AC v3.2.1 and "
"Plane 3.3.0."
msgstr ""
"APM2.6 板已不再支持 Copter 或 Plane。可安装到这些板上的最后固件版本为 AC v3.2.1 和 Plane 3.3.0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/common-autopilots.rst:39 248dc500466a4a9faa7ab56f276de6e1
#: 2bc3cc8a64254809990b7fd42f7e5726 36293157851d4f76a2ab7bdbaace2eda
